# Benchmarks

- Read `benchmarks/AGENTS.md` and root `AGENTS.md` → **Performance: perf_matrix.py**.
- `compare` only accepts prior `run` JSON objects — never `docs/perf_comparison.json`.
- Default `run` overwrites tracked `docs/perf_matrix_*.json/md` — write to `/tmp` unless updating baselines on purpose.
- Do not silently change recipe shapes; preserve comparability (`matrix_compare_key`).
